MERGE precomputed scores — licence
==================================

The precomputed score files distributed with this repository (the hg38 and hg19
.csv.gz files and hg19_liftover_excluded.tsv, attached to its releases), MD5SUMS.txt and
README.md are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0
International licence (CC BY-NC 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

make_hg19.py is released under the MIT licence, as is the code of MERGE-benchmark
(https://github.com/TheFangLab/MERGE-benchmark/blob/main/LICENSE).

Copyright (c) 2026 The MERGE benchmark authors

The files contain outputs of upstream resources that keep their own terms: AlphaGenome
(API offered for non-commercial use), dbNSFP (academic licence; AlphaMissense and ESM-1b
columns) and Nucleotide Transformer (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0). Users are responsible for
complying with each provider's terms.

Research use only. Not a medical device and not for clinical decisions.
